WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.703
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.204
We hope you're doing
well tonight.

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:06.906
And now we're going to
get to the news.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.707
President Biden
spoke yesterday in Buffalo

00:00:08.707 --> 00:00:11.110
and called for
an end to white supremacy.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.445
Well, good luck with that.

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.447
You've been in Washington
a year and a half,

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:16.048
and so far,
the only thing Congress

00:00:16.048 --> 00:00:20.153
has gotten rid of
is Daylight Saving Time.

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:21.421
[ As Biden ]
Now that we took care of that,

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:23.990
move on to white supremacy.

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:29.128
We crushed Daylight Saving Time.
I mean..."

00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:30.597
[ Normal voice ]
President Biden, yesterday,

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:32.598
warned that democracy
is in danger.

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:34.801
Even scarier, in a ransom note.

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:39.605
Former president Trump
recently announced

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:42.108
he is writing a book titled
"The Crime of the Century"

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:43.576
about the alleged voter fraud

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:45.611
in the
2020 presidential election.

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:49.282
Look for it in your bookstore's
Tantrum section.

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:54.053
Pennsylvania Lieutenant Governor
John Fetterman

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:56.055
won last night's
Democratic Senate primary.

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:57.890
Pretty impressive for a guy
who looks like

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:01.494
a character from
"Mike Tyson's Punch-Out!!"

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:05.532
He'll now go on to face
Soda Popinski in the general.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.870
North Carolina Representative
Madison Cawthorn, last night,

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.471
lost his Republican primary.

00:01:12.471 --> 00:01:14.140
Hopefully he will
learn his lesson.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:18.978
Next time you get invited to
a cocaine orgy, just go.

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.850
British Prime Minister
Boris Johnson

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:28.388
recently called for Britons
to return to work in person

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:30.590
and said that his experience
working from home

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.959
included walking
to the fridge and

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:35.495
"hacking off a
small piece of cheese,"

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:38.564
then forgetting what he's doing.

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:39.832
Well, if it helps,

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:44.470
you're supposed to be serving
as prime minister.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.172
Seems like that job
is big enough that

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:49.542
a little piece of cheese
shouldn't throw you off it.

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:52.711
In a recent interview,

00:01:52.711 --> 00:01:56.282
Labor Secretary and former
Boston mayor Marty Walsh

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:58.484
said that Dunkin' Donuts
tasted different

00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:00.086
on a recent trip to South Korea.

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:03.957
Said Biden, "You know that's not
why we sent you, right?"

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:10.897
"Here's the report on
the Dunkins."

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:15.734
According to a new poll,
1 in 3 Americans say that

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:17.737
the coronavirus pandemic
is over.

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:21.207
Unfortunately, he's sitting
between the other two.

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:29.082
"Great.
Between a couple of sheep."

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:33.486
Archaeologists in Laos
recently discovered

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.855
an ancient tooth,
thought to have belonged to

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:40.125
an extinct human species,
that was lodged in a cave wall.

00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:45.198
Experts believed their
last words were, "Not...cake."

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:52.638
He -- He thought...

00:02:52.638 --> 00:02:55.107
So, to work backwards,

00:02:55.107 --> 00:02:58.044
he thought the wall was cake.

00:02:58.044 --> 00:03:00.880
And then he bit it and died.

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:07.386
And, finally, the energy-drink
company Red Bull, last weekend,

00:03:07.386 --> 00:03:10.322
held its world paper-airplane
championship,

00:03:10.322 --> 00:03:13.826
while Four Loko launched its
first-annual Squid Games.

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:17.230
And that -- that was
the monologue, everybody.

